    "Let’s not overlook the compelling power of presentation that AR offers. Gone are the days of hoping your client has a strong spatial imagination (we get it, it’s not for everyone). With AR, you can seamlessly transport them on a virtual tour of their future office building, dream home, or groundbreaking museum. They can genuinely experience the ambiance, the sightlines, and the very essence of the space before a single brick is laid. It’s far more impactful than showing static pictures or sketches; it’s letting them <em>live</em> in it. Talk about a compelling sales pitch – it’s so immersive, they might just try to reach out and touch the virtual furniture."
